      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Side note, slightly off topic but related: The fact that dismissing a group announcement notification uses a **checkmark icon** while dismissing an invite uses an **X icon** is extremely confusing. I still have to double take even after months of seeing these daily, it's really hard to get used to an identical action being portrayed with 2 different icons.",
